te v. Hooper\">703 P. 2d 482</a></span>; No. 85-5844,-Mont.-and-, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"878909\"><a href=\"/opinion/878909/state-v-smith/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: State v. Smith\">705 P. 2d 1087</a></span> and 1110; No. 85-5846, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"1183288\"><a href=\"/opinion/1183288/cartwright-v-state/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Cartwright v. State\">708 P. 2d 592</a></span>; No. 85-5867, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"6759034\"><a href=\"/opinion/6867929/state-v-martin/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: State v. Martin\">19 Ohio St. 3d 122</a></span>, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"6759034\"><a href=\"/opinion/6867929/state-v-martin/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: State v. Martin\">483 N. E. 2d 1157</a></span>; No. 85-5880, <span class=\"citation multiple-matches\"><a href=\"/c/F.%202d/772/668/\">772 F. 2d 668</a></span>.</p>\n</opinion>"},{"id":9051639,"type":"dissent","typeCode":"040dissent","perCuriam":false,"author":"Brennanmarshall","joinedBy":"","pageCount":null,"textLength":591,"isHtml":true,"text":"<opinion type=\"dissent\">\n<author id=\"AZtE\">Justice Brennan and Justice Marshall,</author>\n<p id=\"AVJ_\">dissenting.</p>\n<p id=\"Ah6m\">Adhering to our views that the death penalty is in all circumstances cruel and unusual punishment prohibited by the Eighth and Fourteenth Amendments, <em>Gregg </em>v. <em>Georgia, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9426555\"><a href=\"/opinion/109532/gregg-v-georgia/#227\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Gregg v. Georgia\">428 U. S. 153, 227, 231</a></span> (1976), we would grant certiorari and vacate the death sentences in these cases.</p>\n</opinion>"}],"citations":[]}